        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ray Cooke Auctioneers are delighted to present this spectacular ground floor own door apartment to the market in this prestigious development on Burgage Street, ideally located in the heart of Newcastle Village. This modern setting offers a wide array of amenities right on your doorstep including local shops, schools, sports facilities, Avoca and Rathcoole Park. The 68-bus route is within a short stroll, while the N7, M50 Motorway and the Luas Red Line are easily accessible by car, making this property ideal for commuters. \n\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation comprises an entrance porch, inner hallway, open plan lounge/kitchen/dining room, main bathroom, two spacious bedrooms and a master bedroom ensuite. The open plan lounge opens onto an absolutely stunning, exceptionally large rear garden complete with two storage sheds — a rare and highly desirable addition to any apartment. The property is presented in immaculate condition throughout and further benefits from gas fired central heating, own door access, dual aspect living space, quality flooring, a fitted gloss style kitchen, double glazed windows and ample parking to the front.\n\nAdditional Features:\n- Immaculate condition throughout\n- Ground floor own door apartment\n- Exceptionally large rear garden\n- Two storage sheds\n- Gas fired central heating\n- Double glazed windows\n- Quality flooring throughout\n- Fitted gloss style kitchen\n- Two spacious bedrooms\n- Master bedroom ensuite\n- Dual aspect living space\n- Ample parking\n- Prime village location\n- Viewing highly advised\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE\n\nFill in your contact information and click “Send Message” we will contact you with viewing details when they arise.\n"
      },
